<title>ISRAEL: Palestinian wounds two Israelis on Jordan border.</title>
<headline>Palestinian wounds two Israelis on Jordan border.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Palestinian woman crossing into the Israeli-ruled West Bank from Jordan on Sunday shot and wounded an Israeli security man and an Israeli soldier at the Allenby bridge, police said.</p>
<p>&quot;The security man was hit in the shoulder and the soldier was wounded in the hip, both slightly. The woman, a Palestinian, has been arrested,&quot; a police spokesman said.</p>
